1
00:05:31,764 --> 00:05:37,764
I Am Bruce Lee is a documentary film directed by Pete McCormack.

2
00:11:03,529 --> 00:11:09,529
Bruce Lee is universally recognized as the pioneer who elevated martial arts in film to an art form, and this
documentary will reveal why Bruce Lee's flame burns brighter now than the day he died over three decades ago.

3
00:16:35,294 --> 00:16:41,294
The greatest martial artists, athletes, actors, directors, and producers in the entertainment
business today will share their feelings about the one who started it all.

4
00:22:07,058 --> 00:22:13,058
We will interview the people whose lives, careers, and belief systems were
forever altered by the legendary "Father of Martial Arts Cinema".

5
00:27:38,823 --> 00:27:44,823
Rarely seen archival footage and classic photos will
punctuate the personal testimonials.

6
00:33:10,588 --> 00:33:16,588
Prepare to be inspired.

7
00:38:42,352 --> 00:38:48,352
Self (archival), played by Bruce Lee.

8
00:44:14,117 --> 00:44:20,117
Self, played by Linda Lee Cadwell.

