01:00:49,411 --> 01:00:55,411
Self, played by Diana Lee Inosanto.

12
01:06:21,176 --> 01:06:27,176
Self, played by Kobe Bryant.

13
01:11:52,941 --> 01:11:58,941
I Am Bruce Lee is a 2012 American documentary film
directed and written by Pete McCormack.

14
01:17:24,705 --> 01:17:30,705
The film documents the life of Bruce Lee, the famous actor and martial artist,
featuring interviews with his widow Linda Emery, and daughter, Shannon Lee.

15
01:22:56,470 --> 01:23:02,470
It won a Leo Award in 2012.

16
01:28:28,235 --> 01:28:34,235
The film explores themes of martial arts, biography, martial
arts master, martial artist, east asian lead.
